# Inspect Before Modifying

Before any change:

1. Read the target files and nearby modules.
2. Search for existing services/components/hooks.
3. Reuse abstractions — never duplicate auth, RBAC, storage, or API clients.
4. Check Prisma schema before new models.
5. Check Better Auth before auth changes.
6. Check existing permission catalog before new authorization.
7. Check `@workspace/ui` / shadcn before new UI primitives.
8. Match existing Nest controller → service → DTO patterns.
9. Reuse existing env vars; update `.env.example` only when adding new ones.
10. Search references, API consumers, and tests before breaking changes.

Never blindly overwrite files. Never create parallel implementations of the same concern.
